# Artefacts produced by the tools in this repo.
#
# Note on binaries: fcbenchtool/fcplottool name their output after the
# source with no extension by default (foo.cpp -> foo), which cannot be
# globbed without also matching the tools themselves (fcbenchtool,
# multifaust, ...). Pass an explicit extension — `fcbenchtool foo.cpp
# .bench` — so the output is covered by the rules below.

# wrapper intermediates and compiled benchmarks
*.tmp.cpp
*.bench
*.db
*.db.cpp

# fcasmtool / fcplottool / LLVM dumps
*.s
*.ir
*.o
*.dSYM/

# fcmultibench reports (README convention: foo.bench.json)
*.bench.json

# fcoptimize / fcbenchgraph / fcspillgraph generated reports
*_opt_*.json
*_opt_*.png
*_sensitivity_*.json
*_sensitivity_*.txt
*_sensitivity_*.png
benchmark_*.png
spills_*.png

# Faust-generated C++ dropped next to the .dsp. The only C++ that
# belongs in this repo is the architecture templates, kept below.
*.cpp
!*_header.cpp
!*_footer.cpp

# local experiment scratch, not part of the toolkit
matrix/
